    "description": {
      "value": "<p>[[/attack extended]]. [[/damage extended average]]. If the target is a Humanoid, it is subjected to the following effect.</p><p><em>Constitution Saving Throw:</em> DC [[lookup @save.dc.value activity=lS5miercc4WPdVfN]].</p><p><em>Failure:</em> The target is cursed. If the cursed target drops to 0 Hit Points, it instead becomes a <strong>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.actors24.Actor.mmWereboar000000]{Wereboar}</strong> under the DM's control and has 10 Hit Points.</p><p><em>Success:</em> The target is immune to this [[lookup @name lowercase]]{monster}'s curse for 24 hours.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
